# covers: 11 Thread creation
# covers: 11 Thread termination
# covers: 11 Async functions
# covers: 11 Await
# covers: 11 Futures / Promises
# covers: 11 Task scheduling
# covers: 11 Parallel execution
# covers: 11 Channels
# covers: 11 Message passing
# covers: 11 Task cancellation
# covers: 11 Timeouts
# covers: 11 Producer-consumer patterns
# covers: 11 Structured concurrency
# covers: 21 Async restrictions are enforced
# covers: 22 Concurrent resource contention
# kind: positive
# expect: run
# exit: 0
# stdout: 9
# stdout: 9

concurrency is module
concurrency purpose "Run work in tasks and a bounded group, cancel one, and pass a value through a channel"
concurrency path concurrency
concurrency imports standard.console
concurrency imports standard.time
concurrency imports standard.channel
concurrency imports standard.math
concurrency exports main

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter purpose "Authority to write lines to standard output"
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter scope none

showInt is operation
showInt purpose "Print one whole number on its own line"
showInt invariant none
showInt typeParam none
showInt input value Int64 value
showInt output none
showInt outputOwner none
showInt raises none
showInt effect write console.stdout
showInt uses stdoutWriter
showInt memory heap false
showInt async false
showInt maxRecursion none
showInt label begin loopKind none
showInt label begin within none
showInt label done loopKind none
showInt label done within none
showInt at begin do writeValue
showInt at begin branch ifError writeValue goto done else goto done
showInt at done return ok none

writeValue is call
writeValue rationale "A test program has nowhere to report a failed write"
writeValue in showInt
writeValue invokes console.writeIntegerLine
writeValue arg value Int64 value copy
writeValue out none
writeValue ownedBy none
writeValue cleanedBy none
writeValue borrows none
writeValue catch writeError console.WriteError

Mailbox is instance
Mailbox purpose "A channel of whole numbers between a producer and a consumer"
Mailbox instantiates channel.Channel Int64

square is operation
square purpose "Return a number times itself"
square invariant none
square typeParam none
square input value Int64 value
square output Int64
square outputOwner none
square raises none
square effect none
square uses none
square memory heap false
square async false
square maxRecursion none
square label begin loopKind none
square label begin within none
square at begin do multiply
square at begin return ok squared

multiply is call
multiply in square
multiply invokes math.multiplyInt64
multiply arg left Int64 value copy
multiply arg right Int64 value copy
multiply out squared Int64
multiply ownedBy none
multiply cleanedBy none
multiply borrows none
multiply catch none

warm is operation
warm purpose "Square a number and keep nothing; work started into a group returns nothing"
warm invariant none
warm typeParam none
warm input value Int64 value
warm output none
warm outputOwner none
warm raises none
warm effect none
warm uses none
warm memory heap false
warm async false
warm maxRecursion none
warm label begin loopKind none
warm label begin within none
warm at begin do squareIt
warm at begin return ok none

squareIt is call
squareIt in warm
squareIt invokes square
squareIt arg value Int64 value copy
squareIt out ignored Int64
squareIt ownedBy none
squareIt cleanedBy none
squareIt borrows none
squareIt catch none

main is operation
main purpose "Run the case and print what it computes"
main invariant none
main typeParam none
main input none
main output ExitCode
main outputOwner none
main raises none
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main memory heap true
main async true
main maxRecursion none
main label begin loopKind none
main label begin within none
main label consume loopKind none
main label consume within none
main label done loopKind none
main label done within none
main label failed loopKind none
main label failed within none
main let three immutable Int64 3
main let four immutable Int64 4
main let five immutable Int64 5
main let napMs immutable Int64 10
main let waitMs immutable Int64 100
main let capacity immutable Int64 4
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main let failCode immutable ExitCode 1
main at begin do makeDeadline
main at begin start squareThree
main at begin join squareThree
main at begin do showSquare
main at begin awaitSlot workers
main at begin start squareFour into workers
main at begin awaitSlot workers
main at begin start squareFive into workers
main at begin join workers
main at begin start nap
main at begin cancel nap
main at begin join nap
main at begin do makeMailbox
main at begin start produce
main at begin join produce
main at begin branch ifError produce goto failed else goto consume
main at consume start receiveOne
main at consume join receiveOne
main at consume branch ifError receiveOne goto failed else goto done
main at done do showReceived
main at done return ok okCode
main at failed return ok failCode

workers is taskGroup
workers in main
workers limit 2

mail is region
mail in main
mail strategy arena
mail capacity 4096
mail released atReturn

makeDeadline is call
makeDeadline in main
makeDeadline invokes time.Deadline.after
makeDeadline arg milliseconds Int64 waitMs copy
makeDeadline out deadline time.Deadline
makeDeadline ownedBy none
makeDeadline cleanedBy none
makeDeadline borrows none
makeDeadline catch none

squareThree is task
squareThree in main
squareThree invokes square
squareThree arg value Int64 three copy
squareThree out nine Int64
squareThree ownedBy none
squareThree cleanedBy none
squareThree borrows none
squareThree catch none

