makeMailbox is call
makeMailbox in main
makeMailbox invokes Mailbox.new
makeMailbox arg capacity Int64 capacity copy
makeMailbox arg region Region mail lend
makeMailbox out mailbox Mailbox
makeMailbox ownedBy mail
makeMailbox cleanedBy none
makeMailbox borrows none
makeMailbox catch none

produce is task
produce in main
produce invokes Mailbox.send
produce arg channel Mailbox mailbox lend
produce arg item Int64 nine copy
produce arg deadline time.Deadline deadline copy
produce out none
produce ownedBy none
produce cleanedBy none
produce borrows none
produce catch sendError channel.ChannelError

